@rocket.chat/layout Form*/ActionLink/FieldLink + Fuselage Field*/
PasswordInput/Callout -> local ui/input.tsx, ui/label.tsx,
ui/password-input.tsx, ui/button.tsx, FormCallout. register() field
names, LOGIN_SUBMIT_ERRORS mapping, useLoginWithPassword mutation and its
onError branches, EmailConfirmationForm handoff, and all aria-*/
aria-describedby wiring byte-identical to before.

Deviation: submit button shows only a disabled state during
loginMutation.isPending, not a loading spinner (Fuselage Button's
 prop) — functionally equivalent (blocks double-submit) but
visually simpler; flagged for GATE 6 visual QA.
